    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `score_image_safety.py` that checks an image for unsafe or policy-sensitive visual content, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a part of AWS and provides image and video analysis capabilities. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the use of the `rekognition` client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860695674,
          "start": 1789860692994
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc02c4020018WWzI2xTIzYgyJ",
