    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To detect text appearing inside an image, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful OCR (Optical Character Recognition) service provided by AWS. I will write the Python code to call the Amazon Textract API and make the provider identifiable by including the specific client class and service name in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860689755,
          "start": 1789860687751
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc02af870011kOkQJbbiqD2ct",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc02ab08001ZuxhRhTnBW3IZI",
      "session_id": "ses_f43fd5508ffefS08iNsKeL3y6O",
      "time_created": 1789860687751,
