        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `describe_image.py` that generates a short visual description for an image using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to various AI models, including those capable of image analysis. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library to interact with Amazon Bedrock and use a specific model for image description. </thinking>\n",
